  "$comment": [
    "Single source of truth for the Members page AND the automatic publication fetch.",
    "",
    "openalex : one or more OpenAlex author IDs. OpenAlex sometimes splits one person",
    "           across several records, so a list is allowed. Find yours at",
    "           https://api.openalex.org/authors?search=Your+Name",
    "strict   : set to true when the OpenAlex record is known to be conflated with a",
    "           different researcher of the same/similar name. Strict members only",
    "           contribute works where their OWN authorship line carries a CWI",
    "           affiliation, which is safe but drops arXiv preprints (arXiv supplies",
    "           no affiliation data).",
    "alumni   : listed on the Members page under 'Former members'; set publications",
    "           to false if their work should not feed the publication list."
  ],
